      ],
      "english": [
        "Dhoothalaku lenatti paricharya o priya sakhundaa khyaathigaa",
        "Nee kichche granthambu bheethiyela thinumu granthamu thenevale",
        "Madhuramuga nundhuna jnaanamu neekabbuno hithuda",
        "Jnaanambunondhi swaamini sevinchumo sakhundaa ||Kraisthavaa||"
